    <p class="rvx-vsub" id="story">{{ t('Equal-weight US theme baskets measured against the S&P 500. Use them to see which themes are leading or fading.', '等权重美国主题篮子，对标标普 500。用于观察哪些主题在走强或走弱。') }}</p>
