      <span class="si-vocab" data-tip-en="Board ordering receipt: the fast rotation lens is 20-day relative momentum anchored by 5/10-day fast relative strength, adjusted for cycle state and crowding — display-tier only. Conviction itself is a gated-confluence read: the cycle state leads; the macro regime and the validated absolute-trend drawdown gate gate it; momentum (a focus lens), heat and crowding are capped context. The trend gate is validated for drawdown/staying-power control, not return alpha. No directional odds forecast; the self-grader measures realized accuracy as it accrues. When the fast lens and the conviction tier diverge by two or more steps, a split-view note appears on the card." data-tip-zh="排序说明：快速轮动视角为20日相对动量，以5/10日快速相对强度为锚，并按周期状态与拥挤度调节 — 仅展示层。信念本身为门控共振研判：周期状态主导；宏观体制与经验证的绝对趋势回撤门控进行门控；动量（聚焦视角）、热度与拥挤度为受限背景。趋势门控仅对回撤/持续性控制有效，非收益超额。无方向性概率预测；自评分器随数据累积衡量已实现准确度。当快线与信念层级相差两步及以上时，卡片上显示分歧提示。">?</span></p>
  </section>

